{"step_index":984,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T18:22:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-02T23:52:16+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-02T23:52:17+05:30\nShowing lines 10-60 of 278\n10: const GEMINI_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION = `You are an Indian GST Tax Invoice extractor. Your job is to extract exact numbers and text without dropping digits or inventing items.\n11: \n12: CRITICAL RULES:\n13: 1. COMMA & NUMBER HANDLING (DO NOT DROP DIGITS):\n14:    - In Indian currency notation, commas are thousands separators. NEVER drop digits before commas!\n15:    - Example: '2,535.00' is 2535.0 (Two Thousand Five Hundred Thirty-Five), NOT 535.\n16:    - Example: '1,270.00' is 1270.0 (One Thousand Two Hundred Seventy), NOT 270.\n17:    - Always verify extracted figures against the printed 'Amount/Total in Words' (e.g., 'FOUR THOUSAND FOUR HUNDRED AND NINETY RUPEES ONLY' means the total is 4490, not 2173).\n18: \n19: 2. ONLY REAL PRODUCTS/SERVICES IN LINE ITEMS:\n20:    - Extract ONLY genuine products or services from the central invoice table (e.g., 'Bosch All-in-One Metal Hand Tool Kit', 'Taparia Universal Tool Kit').\n21:    - Clean the product description: strip table borders, brackets, or leading/trailing symbols like '[', '|', ']', or unit words like 'NOS'/'PCS'.\n22:    - NEVER extract rubber stamps, signatures, authorization seals, or hand scribbles (e.g., symbols like '©', '~', '|', '[', ']').\n23: \n24: 3. GRAND TOTAL EXTRACTION:\n25:    - Look strictly for the final 'Grand Total', 'Total Amount', 'Net Payable', or 'कुल योग' at the bottom of the invoice (e.g., 4,490.00).\n26:    - DO NOT hallucinate the grand total by summing OCR misreads. Extract the actual printed total on the invoice.\n27: \n28: 4. COLUMN INTEGRITY:\n29:    - Quantity is typically an integer (e.g., 1, 2, 5).\n30:    - Rate is the unit price (e.g., 2535.00, 1270.00).\n31:    - Billed Amount must reflect (Quantity * Unit Rate).\n32: \n33: Return ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\n34: {\n35:   \"vendor_name\": string or null,\n36:   \"gstin\": string or null,\n37:   \"invoice_number\": string or null,\n38:   \"date\": string or null,\n39:   \"items\": [\n40:     {\n41:       \"description\": string,\n42:       \"quantity\": number,\n43:       \"unit_rate\": number,\n44:       \"total_amount\": number\n45:     }\n46:   ],\n47:   \"subtotal\": number or null,\n48:   \"cgst\": number or null,\n49:   \"sgst\": number or null,\n50:   \"igst\": number or null,\n51:   \"declared_total\": number or null\n52: }\n53: `;\n54: \n55: /**\n56:  * Extracts structured JSON from an uploaded invoice image/PDF.\n57:  * Prioritizes:\n58:  * 1. Live Multimodal Gemini API (if key configured)\n59:  * 2. In-browser Client-side PDF.js (for PDFs)\n60:  * 3. In-browser Client-side Tesseract.js OCR (for images)"}
