e is the unit price (e.g., 2535.00, 1270.00).\\n   - Billed Amount must reflect (Quantity * Unit Rate).\\n\\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\\n{\\n  \\\"vendor_name\\\": string or null,\\n  \\\"gstin\\\": string or null,\\n  \\\"invoice_number\\\": string or null,\\n  \\\"date\\\": string or null,\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"description\\\": string,\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": number,\\n      \\\"unit_rate\\\": number,\\n      \\\"total_amount\\\": number\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"subtotal\\\": number or null,\\n\n<truncated 131 bytes>"}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
